shucking off one's skin.

146
00:10:00,500 --> 00:10:02,340
So I went with "Slip Out."

147
00:10:02,340 --> 00:10:05,740
Like how we're trying to
slip out of our current situation,

148
00:10:05,740 --> 00:10:07,510
to get to something better.

149
00:10:07,510 --> 00:10:11,340
-I like being wrapped with warmness
more than anything else for sure.

150
00:10:11,340 --> 00:10:13,510
-You never know what fate
-I like being wrapped with warmness
