151
00:10:13,510 --> 00:10:15,210
-May bring your way...
-I'm gonna make my coming days
to be filled with laughter and joy

152
00:10:15,210 --> 00:10:19,390
-I'm gonna make my coming days
to be filled with laughter and joy

153
00:10:19,390 --> 00:10:21,290
"1. Pany

154
