5. Hitode"

158
00:10:40,310 --> 00:10:42,170
Hitode really was something.

159
00:10:42,170 --> 00:10:44,370
Yeah, their sound was really tight.

160
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:49,280
Yo! We're going out
with Hitode after the show!

161
00:10:51,820 --> 00:10:55,320
We auditioned for the first Grateful Sound.

162
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:58,490
It was on a huge stage,
and we were nervous.

163
00:10:58,490 --> 00:11:00,990
We've never been more nervous.

164
00:11:00,990 --> 00:11:04,100
Remember this, you're going on
with no rehearsal,

165
00:11:04,100 --> 00:11:05,830
so your first song is
practically thrown away.

166
00:11:05,830 --> 00:11:12,170
Anyway, you guys are probably dead last
of the 94 participating bands.

167
00:11:13,170 --> 00:11:16,340
You there, was it Ryusuke?

168
00:11:16,340 --> 00:11:20,010
You've been scowling the whole time.
You got something against us?

169
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:25,350
-Do you want to eat yu-dofu (hot tofu)?
-Huh?

170
00:11:25,350 --> 00:11:27,080
It's the most popular dish here.

171
00:11:36,700 --> 00:11:40,870
That was hot, damn it!
What the hell d'ya do that for!?

172
00:11:40,870 --> 00:11:42,360
Are you making fun of us?

173
00:11:44,040 --> 00:11:45,200
Watch out!

174
00:11:52,210 --> 00:11:54,550
Hey, you're disturbing
the other customers!

175
00:11:54,550 --> 00:11:56,140
You guys, get out!

176
00:11:57,880 --> 00:11:59,890
Hey, Koyuki, is your face alright?

177
00:11:59,890 --> 00:12:02,560
Yeah, I'm okay. That was
just a sucker punch anyway.

178
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:05,820
I guess we won't be
playing with Hitode again.

179
00:12:13,570 --> 00:12:17,570
I can understand Ryusuke-kun
feeling edgy now, but...

180
00:12:17,570 --> 00:12:22,800
